### Phase 1 proof (R5.3) — run top to bottom against the local development database.
### Format: VS Code "REST Client" / Visual Studio / JetBrains HTTP client.
###
### Before running:
###   - @token      : a Backoffice JWT for the development environment.
###   - @airlineId  : the id of the selling airline.
###   - @currencyId : the id of the currency to price in.
###   - The airline must not yet have the sub codes 0CC and XBG, nor the products XBAG1 and XBAGG.
### Tax code and amounts are test data.
### The quote returns price lines (35.00 Ancillary, 3.50 Tax) and their total (38.50). It says nothing about
### EMD coupon values: on Ordering's EMD the coupon value is the 35.00 only and the 3.50 stays at document level.

@host = http://localhost:4046
@token = PUT-A-BACKOFFICE-TOKEN-HERE
@airlineId = 10
@currencyId = 978

### 1. Enable the industry sub code 0CC (code only) — expect 200, status "Active", source "Industry"
# @name subCode
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/ServiceSubCodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}}, "code": "0CC" }

### 2. Read it — expect 200 with rfic "C", groupCode "BG", subGroupCode null,
###    description1Code "B1", description2Code null, commercialName "FIRST EXCESS BAG"
GET {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/ServiceSubCodes/{{subCode.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Enable 0CC again — expect 409, code 16111
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/ServiceSubCodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}}, "code": "0CC" }

### 4. Try to give an industry code its attributes — expect 422, code 16112
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/ServiceSubCodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}}, "code": "0CC", "rfic": "E", "groupCode": "LG", "commercialName": "LOUNGE" }

### 5. An industry code that is not in the reference — expect 422, code 16114
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/ServiceSubCodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}}, "code": "0CD" }

### 6. Enable the carrier-defined sub code XBG — expect 200, status "Active", source "CarrierDefined"
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/ServiceSubCodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}},
  "code": "XBG",
  "rfic": "C",
  "groupCode": "BG",
  "subGroupCode": null,
  "description1Code": null,
  "description2Code": null,
  "commercialName": "EXTRA BAG"
}

### 7. Define the first-bag product on 0CC — expect 200, status "Draft", version 1
# @name defineProduct
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/AncillaryProducts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}},
  "productRef": "XBAG1",
  "type": "ExtraBaggage",
  "name": "First extra bag 23kg",
  "description": null,
  "salesScope": "TravellerBound",
  "quantity": { "unit": "Piece", "min": 1, "max": 1 },
  "document": { "type": "EmdAssociated", "rfisc": "0CC" },
  "codes": { "serviceTypeCode": "C" },
  "terms": { "refundable": false, "commissionable": null, "reusable": null, "formOfRefundCode": null, "interlineSettlementAllowed": null },
  "inventoryControl": "Unlimited",
  "baggage": { "pieces": 1, "weight": 23, "weightUnit": "Kg" }
}

### 8. Read the product — expect 200, every field as sent, plus document.rfic "C",
###    codes.groupCode "BG", codes.subGroupCode null, codes.description1Code "B1", codes.description2Code null
GET {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/AncillaryProducts/{{defineProduct.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. A product on 0CC that allows two units — expect 422, code 16106
POST {{host}}/Backoffice/v1/AncillaryProducts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerAirlineId": {{airlineId}},
  "productRef": "XBAG2U",
  "type": "ExtraBaggage",
  "name": "Two under first-bag code",
  "description": null,
  "salesScope": "TravellerBound",
  "quantity": { "unit": "Piece", "min": 1, "max": 2 },
  "document": { "type": "EmdAssociated", "rfisc": "0CC" },
  "codes": { "serviceTypeCode": "C" },
  "terms": { "refundable": false, "commissionable": null, "reusable": null, "formOfRefundCode": null, "interlineSettlementAllowed": null },
  "inventoryControl": "Unlimited",
  "baggage": { "pieces": 1, "weight": 23, "weightUnit": "Kg" }
}

