### 23. Same situation, selecting it again — expect 422, code 16305
POST {{host}}/Service/v1/AncillaryQuotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currencyId": {{currencyId}},
  "asOf": "2026-10-01T14:00:00+00:00",
